interface.signature:
interface FreeAgentStore {
  isOpen: boolean;
  currentScope: { kind: 'project' | 'plan' | 'app' | 'workspace'; id?: string };
  activeSessionId: string | null;
  composerText: string;
  // actions
  open(): void;
  close(): void;
  toggle(): void;
  setScope(scope: FreeAgentStore['currentScope']): void;
  setComposerText(text: string): void;
  setActiveSessionId(id: string | null): void;
}

Initial state: isOpen=false, currentScope={kind:'workspace'}, activeSessionId=null, composerText=''.

function useFreeAgentScope(): { kind: 'project' | 'plan' | 'app' | 'workspace'; id?: string }
Behavior: - Reads usePathname() + useSearchParams() from 'next/navigation'. - Derives the scope per the rules in AC #4. - Subscribes to route changes via React effect; updates the store's currentScope on change. - Returns the current scope (also accessible via the store).
Side-effect: calls setScope from the store on mount and on route change.
